Default keyboard and mouse bindings for ''Human Host''. All bindings are rebindable in the '''Options → Controls''' menu.

== Movement ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Action !! Default key
|-
| Move forward || W
|-
| Move back || S
|-
| Strafe left / right || A / D
|-
| Sprint || Left Shift
|-
| Jump || Space
|-
| Crouch || Left Ctrl
|-
| Interact || E
|}

== Combat ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Action !! Default key
|-
| Primary attack || Left Mouse Button
|-
| Aim / block || Right Mouse Button
|-
| Reload || R
|-
| Swap weapon || Q
|}

== Inventory ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Action !! Default key
|-
| Open inventory || I or Tab
|-
| Open crafting menu || C
|-
| Open build menu || B
|-
| Hotbar slots 1–9 || 1–9
|}

== Vehicles ==

Once seated in a vehicle, movement keys drive the vehicle. Additional bindings:

{| class="wikitable"
! Action !! Default key
|-
| Enter / exit vehicle || F
|-
| Handbrake || Space
|-
| Toggle headlights || L (see [[Headlights]])
|-
| Horn || H
|}

